  "anti_inverse_crime_design_note": "All 240 synthetic lots are integrated with the 3-state stiff Radau ODE solver at finite reverse relaxation rate k_-1 (never the rapid pre-equilibrium RK4 solver used for fitting). 70% of each split ('matched': 70 train / 28 val / 70 test) use finite k_-1 in [75, 150] h^-1 with dCp_agg = 0 and no surfactant depletion. 15% of each split ('mismatched_ps80_only': 15 train / 6 val / 15 test) include ONLY late-time PS80 depletion (with dCp_agg = 0 and fast k_-1) as a clean ablation set. 15% of each split ('mismatched_full': 15 train / 6 val / 15 test) combine late-time PS80 depletion + dCp_agg in [0.05, 0.12] kJ/(mol*K) + slower k_-1 in [18, 55] h^-1. Neither structural_group nor structural_subgroup appears in synth_observations.csv or synth_excursions.csv."
